                  <rules>
                    <rule id="f5e3-e06b-bd3b-f7dd" name="Standard Transport" hidden="false">
                      <description>Add enough Rhino Armoured Carriers to transport the entire formation after all other upgrades are chosen. Each Rhino or Damocles Command Rhino carries 2 Tactical-sized units, and the count is set from the formation; add this upgrade last, or adjust the transports if you change units afterwards.</description>
